# Official Tax Sources Only

For The Long Math, do not use third-party tax-table sites, private calculator sites, blogs, or unofficial summaries as a source, citation, cross-check, or verification reference for tax data or tax explanations unless the user explicitly requests that source for a specific task.

Use official sources instead:
- CRA and Government of Canada pages, guides, forms, worksheets, and tax packages
- Provincial and territorial government, finance ministry, tax-package, and open-data sources
- Official legislation or regulations when needed for statutory details

This applies to article content, calculator methodology, calculator data files, tests, docs, prompts, comments, source notes, and generated/public pages.
